        <!-- FAQ -->
        <section id="faq" class="ed-faq scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
          <details open>
            <summary><h3>Is Streamdale a treadmill brand?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              No. Streamdale Furniture is an online seller of furniture and home goods whose catalogue includes a few unbranded folding treadmills and walking pads. It says its products come from manufacturers around the world. Its listings do not name a manufacturer or give a model number, so a Streamdale treadmill cannot be looked up or compared like a branded model.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>Are Streamdale treadmills sold on Wayfair?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              Streamdale says it supplies Wayfair, Home Depot, Lowe's and other marketplaces, but on 14 October 2026 we found no treadmill sold under the Streamdale name on Wayfair. Wayfair often sells supplier products under its own house labels, so a supplier's machine would not necessarily carry its name. We did find Streamdale treadmill listings on Macy's and Shop Simon marketplaces.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>What warranty does a Streamdale treadmill have?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              Streamdale's refund policy does not mention a warranty. It says you may request replacement parts free of charge, and one marketplace listing described parts as available case by case within six months. Neither is a stated motor warranty. Ask the seller in writing how long the motor, controller and frame are covered before you order.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>Can I return a Streamdale treadmill?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              The policy allows return requests within 30 days of receipt for unused items in original packaging, with photos and proof of purchase. You pay return shipping on change-of-mind returns, and on-sale items are not returnable. Damaged or defective items get a return label after you send photos. Confirm the terms for your order before buying.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>How is a Streamdale treadmill delivered?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              By FedEx Ground, FedEx Home or UPS Ground, free to the lower 48 states, with one to three days of processing and two to seven days in transit according to the shipping policy. Parcel delivery usually means the box is left at the door. Listed machine weights run from about 57 to 132 lb, so plan for two people.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>Is Simplie Fun the same as Streamdale?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              They are closely linked. Streamdale's website runs on a store account registered as Simplie Fun, several of its treadmill listings name Simplie Fun as the vendor, and at least one marketplace listing carries both names. Treat them as the same selling operation for the purposes of returns, warranty questions and reviews.
            </p>
          </details>
        </section>

